 "Technology and cyber change":[["Cyberattack or ransomware trend","Systems, data and communications may become unavailable, delaying priority services and recovery."],["Rapid technology obsolescence","Unsupported systems or scarce expertise may increase failure risk and extend restoration times."],["Dependence on cloud and digital services","Loss of connectivity or a third-party platform may prevent access to essential applications and records."]],
