 "Employees and their families":["Employees receive timely safety, welfare and working-arrangement information.","Payroll, essential HR support and employee contact arrangements continue.","Roles, reporting instructions and return-to-work expectations are clear."],
 "Emergency responders":["Current site, hazard, access and emergency-contact information is available.","Safe access, competent site liaison and incident command arrangements are maintained.","Material changes and risks are communicated without delay."],
 "Regulators and authorities":["Statutory notifications and regulatory reporting continue within required timescales.","Evidence of legal compliance and controlled decision-making remains available.","Regulators receive accurate updates on disruption, impacts and recovery actions."],
 "Insurers":["Material incidents and potential claims are notified within policy timescales.","Loss evidence, mitigation actions and expenditure records are retained.","Policy conditions, risk controls and insurer access requirements continue to be met."],
 "Critical suppliers":["Priorities, forecasts and minimum supply requirements are communicated clearly.","Emergency contacts and escalation routes remain available.","Payment, access, information and alternative-delivery arrangements continue."],
