 "Government":["Required public-sector notifications and requests for information are fulfilled.","Essential-service, security or civil-contingency directions are followed.","Accurate information is available to support coordinated public response."],
 "Media":["Accurate, authorised and timely statements are available.","A nominated spokesperson and approval route remain operational.","Confidential, personal and commercially sensitive information is protected."],
